<title>USA: Schultz Sav-O ups qrtly div/splits stock.</title>
<headline>Schultz Sav-O ups qrtly div/splits stock.</headline>
<dateline>SHEBOYGAN, Wis. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shultz Sav-O Stores Inc said Friday  that it is splitting its stock three-for-two and raising its quarterly  dividend by five percent to $0.07 a share on a post-split basis.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed to stockholders in the form of  a 50 percent stock dividend, the company said in a statement.  Shultz  added that both the stock dividend and the cash dividend will be paid  on Sept 5 to shareholders of record on Aug 20.</p>
<p>The company said that after the split, shares of common stock outstanding  will increase to 6,823,892 from 4,549,261.</p>
